\s1 The Evil of Oppression
\p \v 1 \w Again I looked|strong="H7725"\w*, \w and I|strong="H589"\w* \w considered|strong="H7200"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the oppression|strong="H6217"\w* \w taking place|strong="H6213"\w* \w under|strong="H8478"\w* \w the sun|strong="H8121"\w*. \w I saw|strong="H2009"\w* \w the tears|strong="H1832"\w* \w of the oppressed|strong="H6217"\w*, \w and they had no|strong="H369"\w* \w comforter|strong="H5162"\w*; \w the power lay|strong="H3581"\w* \w in the hands|strong="H3027"\w* \w of their oppressors|strong="H6231"\w*, \w and there was no|strong="H369"\w* \w comforter|strong="H5162"\w*. \v 2 \w So I|strong="H589"\w* \w admired|strong="H7623"\w* \w the dead|strong="H4191"\w*, \w who had already|strong="H3528"\w* \w died|strong="H4191"\w*, \w above|strong="H4480"\w* \w the living|strong="H2416"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w are still|strong="H5728"\w* \w alive|strong="H2416"\w*. \v 3 \w But better|strong="H2896"\w* \w than both|strong="H8147"\w* \w is he who|strong="H834"\w* \w has not|strong="H3808"\w* \w yet|strong="H5728"\w* \w existed|strong="H1961"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w has not|strong="H3808"\w* \w seen|strong="H7200"\w* \w the evil|strong="H7451"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w is done|strong="H6213"\w* \w under|strong="H8478"\w* \w the sun|strong="H8121"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w that all|strong="H3605"\w* \w labor|strong="H5999"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w success|strong="H3788"\w* \w spring from|strong="H3588"\w* \w a man’s|strong="H376"\w* \w envy|strong="H7068"\w* \w of his neighbor|strong="H7453"\w*. \w This|strong="H2088"\w* \w too|strong="H1571"\w* \w is futile|strong="H1892"\w* \w and a pursuit|strong="H7469"\w* \w of the wind|strong="H7307"\w*.
