\q2 \w and the advantage|strong="H3504"\w* \w of knowledge|strong="H1847"\w*
\q2 \w is that wisdom|strong="H2451"\w* \w preserves the life|strong="H2421"\w* \w of its owner|strong="H1167"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \w Consider|strong="H7200"\w* \w the work|strong="H4639"\w* \w of God|strong="H430"\w*:
\q2 \w Who|strong="H4310"\w* \w can|strong="H3201"\w* \w straighten|strong="H8626"\w* \w what|strong="H834"\w* \w He has bent|strong="H5791"\w*?
\q1 \v 14 \w In the day|strong="H3117"\w* \w of prosperity|strong="H2896"\w*, \w be|strong="H1961"\w* \w joyful|strong="H2896"\w*,
\q2 \w but in the day|strong="H3117"\w* \w of adversity|strong="H7451"\w*, \w consider this|strong="H7200"\w*:
